{% comment %}
  Kairali Ayurvedic Products — 2026 Luxury Redesign
  snippets/mega-menu.liquid
  Architecture:
    - SHOP (Rich Mega Menu: Skin, Hair, Body, Classical Wellness, Promo Cards, Utility Pills)
    - DISCOVER (Editorial: Classical Pharmacy, Online Vaidya Consultation, Centres, Rituals)
    - ABOUT KAIRALI (Heritage Since 1908, Footprint, Awards, Centres, Contact)
    - JOURNAL (Ayurvedic Wisdom & Blog at /blogs/news)
